{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act40side_level_act40side_09_beg",
  "groupId": "act40side",
  "stageId": "act40side_09",
  "title": "Longevity Noodles",
  "storyCode": "OR-9",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act40side/level_act40side_09_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "26c8079edae6faea19a581c9418285f8f4bf44ae36efc5406f9ceaac3fb32548",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The man takes off his mandarin garb, folds it carefully. and places it down next to the books he used to carry, before bowing three times to the east.\nHe walks out of the camp."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Your flames are indeed hotter now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Your Arts are greatly burdening your body, Infected."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Scared of the heat?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Heh, it's just my blood... Though I know I'm standing here only because so many others have shed their own blood."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Seems like you already know a lot."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Not much at all, but there's just one thing I need to know—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Those who had their names erased, those who died dubious deaths... they need an explanation, an answer."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "To be honest, I didn't think my life would have such a complicated backstory, or that I'd fight for something other than the Infected."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But now I realize that injustice is the same for everyone. And I will spill my blood to end every injustice I encounter."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Burning a blaze with your blood... Infected, you resemble the righteous of old."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But don't rush to conclusions about justice when a single leaf blocks your view of the entire forest."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "In any case, I have been ordered to bring you back, and you absolutely cannot be let free..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I know, I know... I've met your type before, plenty of times."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I guess I can't paint you all as bad guys. You've just been trained to shed no blood or tears... so you stop caring about anyone else's."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Whatever. I won't argue—you sure can try to stop me though."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You are the enemy... but your courage deserves praise."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Careful now. I'll spare your life, but I can't guarantee you won't lose a limb or two."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Zongguan Bailei Zhengfa, cleave!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's you..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Qingyan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I know you have a lot of questions, but there's only one pressing matter at hand."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Qingyan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You wanted to see the True Lung, yes? I'm here to help."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Lin Qingyan? You should be behind bars!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Qingyan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yet I stand here before you now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You've already lost to me once. This time, neither of you will escape."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Qingyan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't worry, I have no plans to fight you alone."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jie Zhen",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I know I asked to tag along..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jie Zhen",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But this opponent... will be hard to handle."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "An accomplice, even..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So you were the one who freed her from prison..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jie Zhen",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I had to employ some crude measures, but I tried my best to avoid harming any innocents."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jie Zhen",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't worry about settling the score. I have too many crimes I can't escape from, and this is just one more. When this matter is over, I will surrender myself to the law."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jie Zhen",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But now, there is something to be done, and a meeting to be had."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A Discipline and Supervision Censor colluding with a Judicial Review Office Deputy Minister in revolt... such a preposterous scene is a first for me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If this is preposterous enough, then allow me to inconsequentially join the fray as well."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Taihe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I trust you've been well, Drillmaster?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Taihe?! Were you not gravely wounded at Yumen—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Taihe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes... my injuries were quite serious. I'm unsure if my skills are even one-third as powerful as they used to be."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Taihe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Which is why I hope there will be no cause for me to make any moves today."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Why would even you participate in this...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Taihe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I have yet to grasp the full picture as to why Deputy Minister Lin has suddenly appeared here. But the two of you are my most respected colleagues, so I can only ask, as an old friend, that you two leave some space for negotiation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How can you expect me to turn a blind eye when you lot insist on doing such a traitorous act?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Taihe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "'Loyalty over righteousness'... But whoever said you could only choose one from the two?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Righteousness..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Qingyan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Stop dallying and go inside!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't even think about—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A signal to lower the Forbidden City's defenses...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Could it be... His Imperial Majesty?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You can see the Forbidden City from here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It was still spring when I last set foot in this tower."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Much has happened within the last six months."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liang Xun",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The chill has come, and the wind atop the city walls is strong. Do take care of yourself, Grand Tutor."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I imagine only a few from the court have seen Baizao from this angle."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Even from great heights, where the view stretches far, one's sight will sometimes be obscured by clouds."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liang Xun",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...All the more reason that one should see and think before one acts."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Do you know why I asked you to become Advisor of Yumen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liang Xun",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "My thoughts were that you wanted me to broaden my horizons and see the big picture. An opportunity, but also a test."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A test for what exactly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liang Xun",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "To see if I am worthy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So you know why I have summoned you here today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liang Xun",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes, Grand Tutor. You are disappointed in me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "An excuse, or a genuine emotion?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liang Xun",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I understand what I did during the Feast of a Hundred Delicacies was a terrible idea. But there was no other way."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liang Xun",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Suspending the Feast will prevent the Grand Commandant from acting in drastic haste, and also allow the True Lung an opportunity."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Since your involvement in this slew of disputes, thrice have you been forced to make a choice, and each time you cast the riskiest die."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You placed your friends and even yourself onto the chessboard... have you never once felt hesitation?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liang Xun",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I dare not claim it never crossed my mind... but I have always considered the choice most beneficial for all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...A capable plotter, but the same cannot be said for your decision-making."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "My plan was to select a young talent—ambitious but not greedy, resourceful but selfless—and give them many chances to hone themselves. If the chance arose, I would entrust them with significant responsibilities."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I thought you were a suitable candidate... but it often does not end well when a chess player uses himself as a piece on the board."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You remind me of a colleague... who is no longer with us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liang Xun",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I am humbled..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Liang Xun, given another chance, would you willingly leave Shangshu?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liang Xun",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "When I started my studies, I was determined to apply my life's learning to the benefit of the people, regardless of whatever position I had gotten from mere chance..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liang Xun",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "My original ambition remains, and I hold no regrets over the choices I made."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hm..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The incident at the Feast of a Hundred Delicacies cannot go unpunished."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liang Xun",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I will submit myself to the law."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The Sky Mirror Pavilion's archive is lacking a transcriber, you will begin your duties there tomorrow morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liang Xun",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You have my gratitude, Grand Tutor."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liang Xun",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What is this...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The time has come."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The clouds concentrate, completely obscuring the moonlight."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liang Xun",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Have you met this one before...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Never."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liang Xun",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Who exactly... is the opponent he seeks on this weiqi board...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "There are times when one seeks not an opponent to win against on the board, but a solution."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A solution beneficial to both parties amid countless changes to the situation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liang Xun",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liang Xun",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "There is something I wish to consult you on..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liang Xun",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What made you set up that exam in the first place?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Passing Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Shop's not closed yet, is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You've come at the right time, I'll close right after I'm done with your order. It's late, so we don't have much left... but what would you like?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Passing Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Anything to fill up my stomach on the road will do."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We happen to have half a steamer of meat buns here from the morning. You can have it for free."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Passing Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Won't you be making a loss like this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I only know how to cook, not so good at business stuff."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Passing Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Why not earn a name and riches with skills like yours?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What for? Both nobles and peasants eat the same three meals a day. I might as well make more buns than money or fame."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Passing Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If you don't mind another question, how much does a meal normally cost here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Not much at all. The usual soup and two dishes just cost a few coins."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Anyone who works here in Baizao can eat their fill here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Passing Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I see you have a kind heart and compassion for others."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Aw, stop that... I'm just a chef who serves about a hundred customers a day at most."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I can only count on you to feed and clothe everyone else in this realm."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Passing Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A free meal, and a lesson to boot... Lucky me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Haha, I just hope you don't get mad at me. I just like aimlessly chatting with customers about everything under the sun."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Passing Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Your restaurant has been here a long time, if I'm not wrong. How are your finances?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Aiya... Now that's a headache. You see, this little store of mine can barely make even."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's all thanks to the abundant crops from Dahuang and the fast deliveries from the Chidao that I can keep my store running. Otherwise, I'd have to raise the prices."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Passing Elder",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Are you sure you're not trying to give credit to your siblings?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Haha... but it doesn't stop here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "My customers all live nearby. Some don't have enough coins, so they make up for it by sending me a few boxes of fresh fruit, or helping me repair the furniture..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Without their care, this restaurant wouldn't be running today."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So, you see... It's hard to balance a book like this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But this is how you do business, right? Who says one side has to profit all the time? You give and you take. It's mutual prosperity that brings wealth and keeps the business thriving."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Your meat buns are ready and all packed, Grand Tutor. But why don't you try one now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Not bad at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A word of advice. Don't take any more lessons from your businessman brother."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Coachman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Were you able to get a meal, sir?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes. I heard the buns from this place are the best in Baizao. Try one yourself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Coachman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Uh... hm... wow, it's delicious."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Coachman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Alright, I'm ready to get back on the road. Where to?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Shangshu..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
